  "prose": [
    {
      "text": "{{rules-take-both}} {{sublocations-are-nameable}} A rule that scopes only by group does not name individual locations, and a rule that scopes by location does not follow a location into new groups; read both arrays."
    },
    {
      "text": "{{authentication-is-a-location-setting}} {{per-rule-caps}}"
    },
    {
      "text": "For a population that changes, {{dynamic-group-for-populations}}"
    },
    {
      "text": "Admin scope uses groups too: [[zia.locations.groups]]. Per-module behavior: [[zia.url-filtering]], [[zia.ssl-inspection]], [[zia.cloud-app-control]], [[zia.firewall]], [[zia.dlp]]. Memberships that appear without an edit: [[zia.locations.group-assignment]]."
    }
  ],
